    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "“这次英语考试是开卷考试，你们可以带任何参考资料来考试。”",
      "traditional": "“這次英語考試是開卷考試，你們可以帶任何參考資料來考試。”",
      "pinyin": "zhè cì yīng yǔ kǎo shì shì kāi juàn kǎo shì nǐ men kě yǐ dài rèn hé cān kǎo zī liào lái kǎo shì",
      "english": "The English teacher said:"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“This English exam is an open book exam. You can bring any reference material to the exam.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明问：“真的什么参考资料都可以带吗？”",
      "traditional": "小明問：“真的什麼參考資料都可以帶嗎？”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng wèn zhēn de shén me cān kǎo zī liào dōu kě yǐ dài ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming asked: “Can we really bring any reference material?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "老师说：“当然。”",
      "traditional": "老師說：“當然。”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī shuō dāng rán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The teacher said: “Of course.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "于是，考试那天，小明带了一个美国人来帮他考试。",
      "traditional": "於是，考試那天，小明帶了一個美國人來幫他考試。",
