      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "老师很生气，说：“你怎么能让美国人来帮你？”",
      "traditional": "老師很生氣，說：“你怎麼能讓美國人來幫你？”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī hěn shēng qì shuō nǐ zěn me néng ràng měi guó rén lái bāng nǐ",
      "english": "And so, on the day of the exam, Little Ming brought an American to help him with the exam."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The teacher got angry and said: “How can you bring an American to help you?”"
